  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Households in target communities have achieved food security and improved nutrition. Increasing target group&#x2019;s knowledge of nutrition and balanced diet; supporting innovative post-harvest practices of the target group;  training and promoting sustainable environmental practices and climate-smart agriculture; support farmers access to Home Grown School Feeding programs. Participants are vulnerable rural smallholder households (men and women), with a special focus on women, youth and people with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
